  "title": "USBC Announces Completion of Corporate Name and Ticker Change Following Strategic Acquisition",
  "summary": "RENO, Nev., Aug. 15, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- USBC, Inc. (NYSE American: USBC) (“USBC” or the “Company”) announced today that it has changed its name from Know Labs, Inc. to USBC, Inc. The Company’s common stock will now trade on the NYSE American under the new ticker symbol “USBC,” effective at",
